{
  "cil_liability": null,
  "url_planning_app": "https://planningsearch.harrow.gov.uk//planning/index.html?fa=getApplication&id=234005",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "lpa_app_no": "PL/0938/26",
  "bo_system": "Portal",
  "reference_no_of_permission_being_relied_on": null,
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;\r\nmso-list:l0 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;&lt;!--[if !supportLists]--&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial&quot;&gt;1.&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposed development, by reason of its failure to provide an appropriate\r\nhousing mix, including a proportion of three-bedroom family homes to meet the\r\nevidenced housing needs of the borough, would fail to deliver an appropriate\r\nhousing mix or contribute to the creation of inclusive and mixed communities.\r\nThe development would therefore fail to meet identified local housing needs,\r\ncontrary to policies S4(2)(c) and HO7 and of the National Planning Policy\r\nFramework (2026), policy H10 of the London Plan (2021), and policies HO1(A) and\r\n(C) and HO2(1), (2), (3), (4) and (5) of the Harrow Local Plan (2021–2041).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;\r\nmso-list:l0 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;&lt;!--[if !supportLists]--&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial&quot;&gt;1.&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--[endif]--&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposed development, by reason of the insufficient gross internal floorspace\r\nof the flats, would fail to provide an adequate standard of living\r\naccommodation for future occupiers. The resulting cramped living conditions\r\nwould be detrimental to the residential amenities of future occupiers, contrary\r\nto policies S4(2)(c), and L2(d)(ii) and (iii) of the National Planning Policy\r\nFramework (2026), policies D3(D)(7) and D6 of the London Plan (2021), and\r\npolicies GR1(C), HO2(2)(a), (c), &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;and (l), and HO2 (3), (4) and (5) of the\r\nHarrow Local Plan (2021–2041).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;\r\nmso-list:l0 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;&lt;!--[if !supportLists]--&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial&quot;&gt;1.&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--[endif]--&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposed development fails to demonstrate that convenient and satisfactory refuse\r\nand recycling arrangements and secure cycle storage can be provided for future\r\noccupiers, to the detriment of their residential amenity, the character and appearance\r\nof the area and the promotion of sustainable modes of transport. The proposal\r\nis therefore contrary to Policies DP3 (2)(d) and DP3(3) of the National\r\nPlanning Policy Framework (2026), Policies D6 and T5 of the London Plan, and\r\nPolicies GR1, HO2(f), CE1(B)(b) and M1(A) of the Harrow Local Plan 2021–2041.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
